# Newsletter Storage Directory

This folder stores classroom newsletter PDFs.

## Naming Convention
Use this format: `YYYY-MM-classroomslug.pdf`

Examples:
- `2025-01-kindergarten.pdf`
- `2025-01-grade-1-2-a.pdf`
- `2024-12-grade-3-4.pdf`

## Adding a New Newsletter

1. Upload your PDF file to this folder
2. Open the classroom's markdown file in `_classrooms/`
3. Add a new entry at the TOP of the `newsletters:` list:

```yaml
newsletters:
  - month: "January 2025"
    title: "Your Newsletter Title"
    file: /assets/newsletters/2025-01-kindergarten.pdf
    description: "Optional description of what's in this newsletter"
  # ... older newsletters below
```

The first newsletter in the list will be displayed as the "Current Newsletter".
